OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'estate agent' listing park   
OL,4,Abenches as homes                       
OL,6,FA homelessness charity has opened a    
OL,7,Fmock estate agent's office with        
OL,8,Flistings such as underpasses and park  
OL,9,Fbenches rather than properties.        
OL,11,F"Wrongmove" has opened in two empty    
OL,12,Fshops in Sheffield city centre as part 
OL,13,Fof a new campaign by the Archer Project
OL,14,Fto highlight rough sleeping during the 
OL,15,Fwinter.                                
OL,17,FInstead of houses, its windows         
OL,18,Fadvertise "some of the city's least    
OL,19,Fdesirable addresses" including a grotty
OL,20,Funderpass, a darkened shop doorway, a  
OL,21,Fsodden park bench, a draughty stairwell
OL,22,Fand a litter-strewn bin alley.         
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
