OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'estate agent' listing park   
OL,4,Abenches as homes                       
OL,6,FEach card lists what it would "cost" to
OL,7,Fstay there, from "a full night's sleep"
OL,8,Fto "your front teeth".                 
